/6000-6777		USER SYMBOLS(FIRST 200 OF THEM ANYWAY).
/7000-7377		MODE SYMBOLS(EITHER PMODE OR LMODE TABLE, DEPENDING ON MODE.).
/7400-7577		PSEUDO OP TABLE PLUS SPECIAL CHARACTER DEFINITION TABLE.
/7600-7777		SUPPOSEDLY UNUSED, BUT WHEN PSEUDO OP TABLE IS LOADED, IT S  LENGTH
