VPRSRV,	0			/THIS ROUTINE PRESERVES LOCATIONS 6400-67777
	JMS I	VPRSRW		/IN THE SCRATCH AREA. CALL THE WRITE ROUTINE
	VSAVE
	JMP I	VPRSRV		/AND RETURN TO THE CALLER.
